00:30:27,637 --> 00:30:30,141
[SPEAKER_00]: It began to rain cats and dogs out in there.

357
00:30:59,457 --> 00:31:13,787
[SPEAKER_01]: One buddy, who was it that you interviewed that had sent Ash, was that who it was?

358
00:31:14,728 --> 00:31:17,670
[SPEAKER_05]: Ash that had sent the baseball hat?

