00:31:27,877 --> 00:31:28,978
[SPEAKER_01]: Well, whoever it was.

361
00:31:29,882 --> 00:31:40,585
[SPEAKER_01]: He had played for Brooklyn, and he had sent his own baseball cap to somebody to have them autograph it, and they never sent it back to him.

362
00:31:40,805 --> 00:31:42,045
[SPEAKER_04]: Oh, he was mad at that.

363
00:31:42,145 --> 00:31:42,725
[SPEAKER_04]: I'll bet.

364
00:31:43,265 --> 00:31:45,326
[SPEAKER_04]: All he ever gets is this stuff.

