00:31:45,346 --> 00:31:48,506
[SPEAKER_04]: Most of them send self-addressed envelopes.

366
00:31:48,826 --> 00:31:50,927
[SPEAKER_04]: And that's a little harsh, you know.

367
00:31:51,047 --> 00:31:54,688
[SPEAKER_04]: Yeah, well, they should, because that mounts up in voltage if you had that.

368
00:31:54,868 --> 00:31:55,248
[SPEAKER_04]: Yeah.

369
00:31:55,798 --> 00:32:01,262
[SPEAKER_04]: I mean, he always loved, you know, loved about him, but he always picked and let him out, right?

370
00:32:01,282 --> 00:32:01,643
[SPEAKER_04]: Yeah.

371
00:32:02,884 --> 00:32:04,024
[SPEAKER_05]: Yeah, well, that makes sense.

372
00:32:04,285 --> 00:32:05,666
[SPEAKER_05]: You know, I think that's good.

